note EventMath Torus — v1.5
note The shape that emerges when you map all the controls.
note Not a sphere. A torus. The nucleus switches — it is the hole.
note Stacking squares, not polygons. Fibonacci emerges from the count.

note ── The two primary states ──

event not knowing
category state
matter
  description is the starting condition before mastery
  energy is low
  direction is away
end
end

event knowing
category state
matter
  description is the arrived condition of mastery and fluency
  energy is high
  direction is toward
end
end

note ── Build the control structure ──

zoom in on not knowing and knowing into learning bridge

zoom opposite on learning bridge into resistance bridge

zoom meta on not knowing and knowing and learning bridge and resistance bridge into learning field

note learning field is now at zoom level 3
note it governs: not knowing, knowing, learning bridge, resistance bridge

note ── Spin the field into a torus ──

spin learning field into knowledge torus

note knowledge torus is the shape that emerges
note the nucleus is the switch: present when total+1 is Fibonacci

note ── Vibrate outward: 8 rings ──

vibrate knowledge torus across 8

note Ring 1:  4 pts  →  outer: 4   +nucleus = 5   Fibonacci ✓
note Ring 2:  4 pts  →  outer: 8   +nucleus = 9
note Ring 3:  4 pts  →  outer: 12  +nucleus = 13  Fibonacci ✓
note Ring 4:  4 pts  →  outer: 16  +nucleus = 17
note Ring 5:  4 pts  →  outer: 20  +nucleus = 21  Fibonacci ✓
note Ring 6:  4 pts  →  outer: 24  +nucleus = 25
note Ring 7:  4 pts  →  outer: 28  +nucleus = 29
note Ring 8:  4 pts  →  outer: 32  +nucleus = 33

note ── Cross-level resonance ──
note learning bridge and resistance bridge vibrate at the same frequency
note they are at different zoom levels but they resonate — they know each other

resonate learning bridge and resistance bridge

note ── Complete the cycle ──
note the 33rd outer point + nucleus = 34 — the next Fibonacci is 34
note cycle marks the return to 1, one level up

cycle knowledge torus

note ── Output ──

show knowledge torus
